{"resourceIdentifier":"4921","resourceName":"Gaotang Municipal Solid Waste Incineration For Power Generation Project","description":"Gaotang Municipal Solid Waste Incineration for Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at Gaotang County, Liaocheng City, Shandong Province, P.R China. The Project is owned and implemented by Gaotang Guohuan Renewable Resources Co., Ltd.\r\nThe project is established for the purpose of treatment of municipal solid waste (“MSW”) with energy recovery and electricity generation and no heat recovered for thermal generation is involved. The project is designed to dispose of a daily average 600 tons of MSW through one incineration systems with the treatment capacity of 600 tons/d of MSW, matched with one set of 12 MW condensing turbine and one set of 12 MW turbo generators. The project will dispose of 219,000 tons of MSW every year, and consume 108 tons of light diesel as auxiliary fuel every year. The expected average electricity generation will be 73,510 MWh per year, of which 63,220 MWh will be delivered to the North China Grid Company Limited(NCGC).\r\nThe project will dispose of the MSW by incineration technology to avoid CH4 emissions from the disposal of the waste at Gaotang municipal landfill site. Furthermore, the greenhouse gas (GHG) emission reductions can also be achieved by the displacement of the electricity from fossil fuel-fired plants connected to the NCGC, by electricity generated from recovered MSW combustion heat.","location":{"latitude":36.861585,"longitude":116.318189},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-06-03","endExclusive":"2024-07-04","endInclusive":"2024-07-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4921"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gaotang Guohuan Renewable Resources Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Gaotang County, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86-18253722790"},{"type":"string","value":"gthc@conchventure.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"66240"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10/12/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 05/08/2022 - 04/08/2032"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=111334&IDKEY=fq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk153529586","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS_Listing-Representation-Single-Gaotang.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-04-15T07:10:01.21Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=124237&IDKEY=fkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909s171322823","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD 4921 v1.5 clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-12-10T11:05:10.63Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=116770&IDKEY=f0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla99161025830","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"VCS 4921 Registration-Representation-Single-PP-v4.4.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-08-04T10:46:19.217Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.